at customer.","id":"REQ-5","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"overdue invoices with days overdue 7, 30, 31, 60, 61, 90 and 91","id":"AC-6.1","level":"api","then":"7–30 returns 7 and 30; 31–60 returns 31 and 60; 61–90 returns 61 and 90; 90+ returns only 91","when":"the overdue list is requested with each bucket in turn"},{"given":"customer A has overdue invoices at 10 and 40 days and customer B has overdue invoices at 10 and 40 days","id":"AC-6.2","level":"api","then":"only customer A's 40-day invoice is returned","when":"the overdue list is requested with customer A and bucket 31–60"},{"given":"any data","id":"AC-6.3","level":"api","then":"the response is 400 and names the allowed bucket values","when":"the overdue list is requested with a bucket value that is not one of the four buckets (e.g. 5-9)"}],"ears":"When the overdue list is requested with a days-overdue bucket filter of 7–30, 31–60, 61–90 or 91 and over (90+), the invoice reminders API shall return only overdue invoices whose days overdue falls inside that bucket, bounds included.","id":"REQ-6","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","ASM-4","ASM-5"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"no authentication credentials","id":"AC-7.1","level":"api","then":"each response is 401 with no invoice or customer fields in the body, the email provider stub receives no request, and no reminder history row is created","when":"the overdue list, invoice detail and send-reminder endpoints are each called"},{"given":"an expired or invalid staff token and an overdue invoice","id":"AC-7.2","level":"api","then":"both responses are 401 and the email provider stub receives no call","when":"the overdue list endpoint and the send-reminder endpoint for that invoice are called"}],"ears":"If a request to the overdue list, invoice detail or send-reminder endpoint has no valid staff authentication under the existing API's authentication scheme, then the invoice reminders API shall reject it with HTTP 401, return no invoice or customer data, and send no email.","id":"REQ-7","op":"ADDED","sources":["Q-1"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"overdue invoice INV-100 (amount 250.00, due 2026-10-01) belongs to a customer with email accounts@crumb.example, and a stubbed email provider","id":"AC-8.1","level":"api","then":"the response is 2xx and the provider stub receives exactly one send request addressed to accounts@crumb.example whose body contains 'INV-100', '250.00' and '2026-10-01'","when":"the send-reminder endpoint for INV-100 is called with a valid staff token"},{"given":"the template in configuration is changed to a different subject line","id":"AC-8.2","level":"api","then":"the provider stub receives the new subject line","when":"a reminder is sent"}],"ears":"When an authenticated staff user sends a reminder for an overdue invoice whose customer has an email address, the invoice reminders API shall send one email through the configured transactional email provider to the single email address on the customer record, using the configured template and containing the invoice number, amount and due date.","id":"REQ-8","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","Q-5","Q-7","ASM-6","ASM-7","ASM-8","ASM-16"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"overdue invoice INV-200 belongs to a customer whose email field is empty","id":"AC-9.1","level":"api","then":"the response is 422 with a message saying the customer has no email address, the provider stub receives no request, and no reminder history row is created","when":"the send-reminder endpoint for INV-200 is called with a valid staff token"}],"ears":"If the customer record of the invoice has no email address, then the invoice reminders API shall reject the send-reminder request with HTTP 422 and an error saying the customer has no email address, shall not call the email provider, and shall not record a reminder history entry.","id":"REQ-9","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","Q-7","ASM-7"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"invoice IN